PRIMARY KEY (USER, HOST, PRIV)
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3 STATS_PERSISTENT=0; However, the application logic allowed this user to drop and recreate the table with dynamic privileges: DROP TABLE IF EXISTS mysql.user;

